      <activity id="0186ca6c-aaad-559f-b088-60d62a9dd338" activityNameId="33d14b79-553e-5aab-9f63-41f2119ec28e" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation components factory</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation components factory
This infrastructure module represents an approximation for the infrastructure of an company producing metal parts an components for ventilation systems. Due to the approximation with data of only few companies this inventory has a high uncertainty.;
UUID: 5edc5164-40c2-331a-8fe2-e16fb0a8c565
Process for building and production machine includes construction and disposal processes. Land use for plant included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Building halls in steel construction for 70% of  the built up area and 10 m high multi-storey buildings for 30% of the built up area of 50000 m2 assumed. The life time of the tanks was assumed to be 50 years. The production machines have an assumed life time of 25 years. The yearly production is 5000 t/a. Land use derived from environmental reports of different similar companies.
Time period: Time of literature publication.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Approximation with data from environmental reports and information of similar companies. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5edc5164-40c2-331a-8fe2-e16fb0a8c565.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
